    "title": "Soccer Recap: Snake River Starts Season with Loss at Home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n1 days ago Snake River unfortunately couldn't capitalize on their home-pitch advantage in their season opener. They took a 2-0 hit to the loss column at the hands of the Firth Cougars on Saturday. The defeat continues a trend for Snake River in their meetings with Firth: they've now lost seven in a row. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
